      "title": "Samsung’s TriFold Phone Might Not Be Dead After All",
      "content_html": "On the foldables front, ETNews says Samsung will launch a “Z Fold TriFold 2” with next year’s Z Flip 9, Z Fold 9, and Z Fold 9 Ultra phones. Before discontinuing sales for it, Samsung had said the Z TriFold was always intended to be limited production, designed to showcase its display and hinge innovations. The company reportedly produced only 30,000 units worldwide.",
