      "id": "https://kottke.org/26/07/the-drawing-room-with-mo-welch",
      "url": "https://kottke.org/26/07/the-drawing-room-with-mo-welch",
      "title": "The Drawing Room With Mo Welch",
      "content_html": "<p>Comedian Mo Welch has a new show on PBS called <a href=\"https://www.pbs.org/show/the-drawing-room-with-mo-welch\">The Drawing Room</a>, where she interviews people while she draws them (and her guests draw her). What a great idea for a show.</p>\n\t<p>The first three episodes are live already: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GrRLJn1Kbkc\">Brett Goldstein</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NNZssO5diPg\">Sarah Silverman</a>, and violinist <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4fWMtRSHvqg\">Vijay Gupta</a>; here’s the premiere episode with Goldstein:</p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p>Each episode is only 10-12 minutes long. The lineup of guests for the rest of the season <a href=\"https://www.pbs.org/about/about-pbs/blogs/news/pbs-digital-studios-and-pbs-socal-announce-new-original-series-the-drawing-room-with-mo-welch\">include</a> Demi Adejuyigbe, Tig Notaro, Adam Conover, and Aparna Nancherla.\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Brett%20Goldstein\">Brett Goldstein</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/interviews\">interviews</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Mo%20Welch\">Mo Welch</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/PBS\">PBS</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/TV\">TV</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/video\">video</a></p>",
